{"id":71180,"date":"2026-10-28T09:19:03","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:19:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71180"},"modified":"2026-10-28T10:20:29","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:20:29","slug":"corrida-dom-dinis","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-dom-dinis\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Dom Dinis 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Dom Dinis 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Dom Dinis 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, com in\u00edcio de provas \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> junto ao hist\u00f3rico <strong>Mosteiro de S\u00e3o Dinis e S\u00e3o Bernardo (Largo Dom Dinis)<\/strong>, em <strong>Odivelas<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Inserido nas comemora\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais do 28\u00ba anivers\u00e1rio do Munic\u00edpio de Odivelas, o evento \u00e9 limitado a um m\u00e1ximo de <strong>1.500 participantes<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo abre \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> com a <strong>Corridinha do Dinis<\/strong> (provas gratuitas para escal\u00f5es jovens dos Bambis aos Juvenis, entre 150 metros e 2.000 metros), seguida \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong> pela prova principal de <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> em circuito urbano de estrada (com abastecimento l\u00edquido aos 5 km e na meta) e \u00e0s <strong>10h20<\/strong> pela <strong>Caminhada de 4 km<\/strong> aberta a todas as idades.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o pertence \u00e0 <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Odivelas<\/strong>, com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Centro de Marcha e Corrida de Odivelas<\/strong> e dos <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Odivelas<\/strong>. O levantamento do kit de atleta (dorsal, chip para os 10 km e medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o) decorre na v\u00e9spera, s\u00e1bado, <strong>21 de novembro, das 11h00 \u00e0s 17h00<\/strong>, no <strong>Parque Multidesportivo Na\u00edde Gomes<\/strong>. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">22 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Mosteiro de S\u00e3o Dinis e S\u00e3o Bernardo (Largo Dom Dinis), Odivelas, Lisboa<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width